d checking out Tsunami sushi. Modern atmosphere, friendly service. Difficult to park, but I'll be back."},{"business_id":"Et2yOijYQbWyR-mE0-z40w","review_id":"x8U-zsybiNzBAjyfrsuO8g","date":"2018-08-25T14:31:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9409154653549194,"text_excerpt":"Had an amazing dining experience at the Sushi bar here. The people in the kitchen and the waitress I had were amazing. Being a frequent traveler and constantly meeting people it's difficult to remember names but my server at the bar asked one of the chefs (Edgar) to create not only a Mexican roll (which was delicious) but also a couple pieces of sashimi that were perfectly cut and presented. I highly recommend this place for an amazing sushi experience. I will be back soon!"},{"business_id":"Et2yOijYQbWyR-mE0-z40w","review_id":"8fqL0zroJV1fRW1ElSVSwA","date":"2018-06-19T14:11:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9406976103782654,"text_excerpt":"Fairly new sushi spot. Really fresh sushi. We shared a sushi dinner they have which gives you quite the variety, tuna, salmon, yellowtail, and another selection. It was really great and so damn fresh. We also had the salmon tartare special, wasn't my cup of tea Bc it had too much mayo in it. Great service. We ended up getting a bottle of wine and that was smart of us Bc they have a deal on bottles of wine. They also have a \"club\" you can join. It's a card and it affords you a percentage off your bill on visits. I'll definitely be back. I'm a fan!!!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Et2yOijYQbWyR-mE0-z40w","photo_id":"SDU0VSlNgTMLdiD9x0J7Lw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/SDU0VSlNgTMLdiD9x0J7Lw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8688298463821411},{"business_id":"Et2yOijYQbWyR-mE0-z40w","photo_id":"jroJW_I68BqPvn670iJRpA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jroJW_I68BqPvn670iJRpA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8553832769393921},{"business_id":"Et2yOijYQbWyR-mE0-z40w","photo_id":"p6J1aZcij5QqmEjLVVDsPw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos